{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And to Shem were born</b> etc. Here it counts them in the order of their genealogies: the sons of Japheth etc., the sons of Ham etc., <b>and to Shem were born</b> etc. This tells you that this is precisely the order, and therefore 'Japheth the elder' is written here. And the fact that Scripture mentioned him several times before his brothers — this counts his importance. 'The brother of Japheth' — who partnered with him to honor their father."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:46.616626326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}